[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Message from the Lord Chamberland of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Dishonorable scum!  I'll have your traitorous hide if it's the last thing I do...


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You and the Chamberland of Thunder has crushed the tratiorous Trallen and two more of your enemies.  Your clan and allies continue to grow, but there is still considerable forces left to oppose your rule.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron42ex

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from Trallen</h2>
<p>
You maybe a good fighter but I am better than you!

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Chamberland of Thunder</h2>
<p>Now that I'm one less an ally, I would be honored to be your ally and friend.

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Chamberland of Thunder</h2>
<p>
I shall finish you quite painfully.

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Betrayl</h2>
<i>"Some people have no honor"<br>
--Walen Ris</i>  
<p>During a meeting between you and the Chamberland of Thunder some of your foes has decided to attack.  To make situations worse the Chamberland's ally, Trallen, has defected to the attacker's side!  Your allies are currently holding the attackers at bay.  You must win this battle to gain the Chamberland's favor, and the alliance you seek.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>Message from the Lord Trallen</h2>
<p>
You are a fool my Lord Chamberland!  I will not be a part of this alliance!

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Duke of Thunder</h2>
<p>Argh!  I'm under attack!

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Duke of Thunder has died!</h2>
<p>
Without the Duke of Thunder to maintain the front line, the enemy rushed in and overwhelmed you and the Chamberland on his Island.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai6PriestDead]
<h2>The Lord Chamberland of Thunder has died!</h2>
<p>
When news of the Chamberland's death was heard, many of his followers waged war against you and your allies.  In the end you won the war but your allies and your clan suffered many casualties.  The other clans took advantage of the situation and you were ultimately killed. 

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai7TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from the Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
If you are done chatting with the Chamblerland I would like some help!

[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
After disposing of the Knight of Wind the enemy attack force pressed on to support Lord Trallen.  Unable to deal with the additional forces the Chamberland and you retreated.  Some hours later they caught up with you both and were captured. 

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai8PriestDead]
<h2>A message from the Chamberland of Thunder</h2>
<p>
You are good fighters, I will consider this alliance once this is over with.

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Seems Lord Trallen was right in not accepting the alliance.  
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]


